<title>GERMANY: Heildelberger Zement keeps CBR stake steady.</title>
<headline>Heildelberger Zement keeps CBR stake steady.</headline>
<dateline>HEIDELBERG, Germany 1996-12-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>German construction group Heidelberger Zement AG said on Friday that it still holds at 48.9 percent stake in its Belgian unit CBR S.A.</p>
<p>The German group said other shareholders declined to make use of an option to offer their shares to Heidelberger Zement.</p>
<p>A warrant would have enabled shareholders to receive 2,350 Belgian francs for five shares.</p>
<p>But the group's share price was above this level during the period in which the warrant could have been exercised.</p>
<p>--Frankfurt Newsroom, +49 69 756525</p>
</text>
